{
"markdown": "### iOS 27 Animations\n\n**iOS 27 animations for iOS 15 - 16.** Brings fluid open/close animations and gorgeous spring physics to older iOS releases.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://repo.ba31k.com/depictions/com.bazik1337.ios2627anims/screenshots/1-close.jpg",
"accessibilityText": "Closing an app: the window bends into its icon"
},
{
"url": "https://repo.ba31k.com/depictions/com.bazik1337.ios2627anims/screenshots/2-close.jpg",
"accessibilityText": "Genie effect on the way home"
},
{
"url": "https://repo.ba31k.com/depictions/com.bazik1337.ios2627anims/screenshots/3-icon.jpg",
"accessibilityText": "The icon lands in place"
},
{
"url": "https://repo.ba31k.com/depictions/com.bazik1337.ios2627anims/screenshots/4-settings.jpg",
"accessibilityText": "Settings"
},
{
"url": "https://repo.ba31k.com/depictions/com.bazik1337.ios2627anims/screenshots/5-advanced.jpg",
"accessibilityText": "Advanced settings"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 12,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **App Open & Close:** The iOS 27 genie effect: windows bend out of and back into icons with realistic springs and bounce.\n- **Notification Center:** Icons fly back into place smoothly when closed, with no background blur.\n- **Advanced Settings:** Easily configure opening/closing speeds, window bending, bounce physics, and slow motion in Settings.\n- **Full Compatibility:** Works seamlessly with SnowBoard icon scaling. Supports rootless (Dopamine, palera1n, roothide) and rootful environments.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
